  (text "HUB - one per kit" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid c9700b25-1b0d-5d8d-85fa-ab349b4ee0ca))
  (text "Runs the games, the WiFi AP \"Airsoft-Master\" (app at http://192.168.4.1) and ESP-NOW to the targets." (at 15.24 19.05 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4e577523-f3e5-5b1d-b76e-901987c39798))
  (text "POWER\nMicro-USB: USB power bank or charger (about 0.5 W).\nNothing else is wired. No PSRAM, 4 MB flash." (at 190.5 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 94dc46e8-080a-54cd-ab75-8ff9519cef1d))
  (text "FREE FOR ADD-ONS\nGPIO4, 5, 13, 14, 16-19, 21-23, 25-27, 32, 33.\nGPIO34-39: input only, no pull-ups.\nAvoid GPIO0, 2, 12, 15 (boot straps) and GPIO1/3 (USB serial)." (at 190.5 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 26ad47b9-292f-579c-9595-4653988476c0))
  (text "BOARD VARIANTS\nPin numbers follow the 30-pin DOIT DevKit V1. 38-pin boards have\nthe same GPIOs in a different header order: wire by GPIO name." (at 190.5 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid e7a30e76-2597-5013-bfe9-fafb3169c8b0))
